#: ../../openmvcam/shields/driver-shield.rst:212
msgid ""
"With the mode jumper floating, each pin becomes a stand-alone line driver "
"routed to one output — useful for solenoids, relays, or any on/off load that"
" doesn't need an H-bridge. The mapping is P7 → O1, P0 → O2, P8 → O3, and P1 "
"(or P2) → O4::"
msgstr ""
"Con il jumper di modalità lasciato flottante, ciascun pin diventa un line "
"driver autonomo instradato a una uscita — utile per solenoidi, relè o "
"qualsiasi carico on/off che non necessita di un ponte H. La mappatura è P7 →"
" O1, P0 → O2, P8 → O3 e P1 (o P2) → O4::"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/driver-shield.rst:233
msgid ""
"Any of the four pins can also be PWM'd via :class:`machine.PWM` for "
